<section class="section" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title" style="background:var(--card);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="container">
    <header style="margin-bottom:32px">
      <span class="tag">What we do</span>
      <h2 id="services-title">Scaffold encapsulation & site containment</h2>
      <p>Compliant weatherproof containment for builders and scaffolders across Sydney. Shrink-wrap systems that seal tight, shed water, and meet site safety requirements.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:8px">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Core service</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Scaffold encapsulation</h3>
        <p>Full scaffold wrap systems - sheeted, tensioned, and sealed bay by bay. Sheeted, tensioned and sealed bay by bay to suit your scaffold.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Core service</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Site containment</h3>
        <p>Perimeter containment, debris netting, and dust control screens. Keeps sites compliant and neighbours happy.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Specialist</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Shrink wrap weatherproofing</h3>
        <p>Heat-shrunk membrane systems for roofs, openings, and temporary enclosures. Watertight, durable, fast to install.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Compliance</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Compliant containment for builders</h3>
        <p>Systems that satisfy NSW SafeWork and principal contractor requirements. Documentation and certification on request.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start">
    <div>
      <span class="tag">About Fay's Solutions</span>
      <h2 id="about-title">Sydney's shrink-wrap specialists</h2>
      <p>Fay's Solutions Encapsulations operates across Greater Sydney, delivering scaffold encapsulation and site containment for commercial and residential projects. We work directly with scaffolders, builders, and principal contractors to provide compliant, weatherproof containment that protects sites, programs, and people.</p>
      <p>We work directly with scaffolders, builders and principal contractors, so every wrap gets consistent tension, sealed seams and a single point of accountability from quote to handover.</p>
      <ul style="margin:24px 0 0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;line-height:2">
        <li>Shrink wrap specialists - scaffold encapsulation & site containment</li>
        <li>Weatherproof. Safe. Compliant.</li>
        <li>Serving builders and scaffolders across Sydney NSW</li>
        <li>Instagram: <a href="https://instagram.com/fayssolutions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@fayssolutions</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="height:fit-content">
