  </div>
</section><section class="section" id="quote" aria-labelledby="quote-title" style="background:var(--card);border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start">
      <div>
        <span class="tag">Get a quote</span>
        <h2 id="quote-title">Request a quote for your project</h2>
        <p>Tell us the scope - scaffold size, wrap area, timeline, and any compliance requirements, and we'll come back with a clear, itemised price.</p>
        <ul style="margin:24px 0 0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:2">
